                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99f7ff5c-63b6-3d19-8064-c0ce8c6b2dfb",
                                        "entry_id": "b4ff4228-bb4a-33ba-acc5-372b98416121",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of decision making."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139a9196-bfea-47be-ba61-0ada81a74078",
                                                "sense_id": "99f7ff5c-63b6-3d19-8064-c0ce8c6b2dfb",
                                                "text": "But what if Google's biggest problem isn't a lack of flexibility or the speed of its decision-making, but a fundamental cultural inability to create new lines of business that can keep the company growing? What if it's just a gargantuan one-trick pony?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99141a3a-73fd-4521-b17b-9e5febfb5dda",
                                                "sense_id": "99f7ff5c-63b6-3d19-8064-c0ce8c6b2dfb",
                                                "text": "The projects, which are due to start in November, are: [...] Rail performance modelling for strategic decision-making - [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e58be530-b9af-4bf6-b15c-0b1d3669660f",
                                                "sense_id": "99f7ff5c-63b6-3d19-8064-c0ce8c6b2dfb",
                                                "text": "Transport Minister Mulley, with just six months left in office before Harold Wilson's Labour government was toppled by Edward Heath's Conservatives, was hamstrung by inefficient working practices - although thankfully for him he did not have to answer to 2020-style media questioning over why slow decision-making allowed costs to escalate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ca1ce02-9cb2-42dc-9c53-88fc129321f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d9b16fe-2e65-302e-8852-7f8e48dfdfc5",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0b36e89-fb35-3034-97db-7facd97b24cb",
                        "target_lang_word": "beslissingnemer",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "beslissingnemer",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fde01679-7bff-3365-a0c5-6b6f28ac960b",
                                        "entry_id": "b79678a0-4ddb-3cd2-a7bc-51824af98972",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "leidinggevende die gemachtigd is om beslissingen te nemen; iemand die knopen mag doorhakken"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc3845dc-fc97-4942-aa61-3c06a889fcf7",
                                                "sense_id": "fde01679-7bff-3365-a0c5-6b6f28ac960b",
                                                "text": "Op Premier Business Leadership Series, de conferentie van softwarebedrijf SAS Institute voor bedrijfsleiders en beslissingnemers, kregen de aanwezigen een vooruitblik op de wetenschap van de toekomst ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a38f8a54-5b99-4e31-aadc-cc42dd31ec12",
                                                "sense_id": "fde01679-7bff-3365-a0c5-6b6f28ac960b",
                                                "text": "De vorsers ontdekten bovendien dat de inschatting van een storm niet met de algemene indruk van een bevraagde over geslachtsrollen betrekking heeft. Ook personen die stereotypen in principe afwijzen, beoordeelden orkanen met vrouwennamen als milder. Beslissingnemers moeten er daarom over nadenken om het systeem van de naamgeving te veranderen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
